# A3CW Rev-B TSN daughterboard contract:
#   MxL86211 TX0 P/N -> FPGA MRPHY RX P/N on K30/K29
#   FPGA MRPHY TX P/N on P30/P29 -> MxL86211 RX0 P/N
# Quartus validates these four balls as bank-1A high-speed differential I/O
# on the selected A3CW135BM16AE6S.
